From 460884c847a8bbbabc805e525120732a92e05ae7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: joe214214 <y852zhou@uwaterloo.ca>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:48:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] feat(multimodal): steer models to the media tools with
 prompt guidance

With a working bash sandbox, the model extracted video frames with ffmpeg
and read_image instead of calling read_video. Following tool-fs, each media
tool now adds one scoped system-prompt sentence pointing at itself, at
centrally allocated section orders; memory context takes a central context
order as well.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HKCB8j9Zf27m5tAmJdbkFm
